{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDExLS0yMDIwL0hlciUyMEJsdWUlMjBTa3klMjAlMjgyMDE5JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Her Blue Sky","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/c2UTAPcfIrvgDVYzpX4R8RSV6tF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k1jWHgAICsNGM5roYcIwaDpryYS.jpg","description":"High school student Aoi Aioi lives with her elder sister, Akane, after a tragic accident took their parents away 13 years ago. Because Akane has since been taking care of her single-handedly, Aoi wants to move to Tokyo after her graduation to relieve her sister's burden and pursue a musical career, inspired by Akane's ex-boyfriend Shinnosuke \"Shinno\" Kanamuro. Shinno was part of a band until he left for Tokyo to become a professional guitarist after the sisters' parents passed away, and he was never to be seen again.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Animation","Romance","Animation"],"imdbRating":"7.4","runtime":"108 min","cast":["Shion Wakayama","Ryo Yoshizawa","Riho Yoshioka","Ken Matsudaira","Fukushi Ochiai","You Taichi","Atsumi Tanezaki","Yuto Uemura"],"director":["Tatsuyuki Nagai"],"released":"2019-10-11T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Shion Wakayama","character":"Aoi Aioi (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b697ggFreuliEfl4TjLgxhJCQXr.jpg"},{"name":"Ryo Yoshizawa","character":"Shinnosuke Kanamuro / Shinno (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1FJI3Vw8rsTxG03ZObbTAvn380a.jpg"},{"name":"Riho Yoshioka","character":"Akane Aioi (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b8DoAyEouFQJt15EtAl9ASKiJP9.jpg"},{"name":"Ken Matsudaira","character":"Dankichi Nitobe (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/Afbl1n8m3VXWDD5FPIZikEJtAZM.jpg"},{"name":"Fukushi Ochiai","character":"Masamichi Nakamura (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xE2FoiUjb9N51J7jg0U8eGmfK19.jpg"},{"name":"You Taichi","character":"Masatsugu Nakamura (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bt